        "date": "2026-05-07T21:55:57Z"
      },
      "message": "Show a grand success screen after a successful zap\n\nPreviously, a successful send from the Zap dialog auto-closed and surfaced a\ntoast. That undersold what just happened — the user sent Bitcoin. Now both\nrails (on-chain + Lightning) flip the dialog over to a dedicated success\nscreen with an animated check, amount, recipient card, rail indicator, and\n(for on-chain) a \"View transaction\" link to mempool.space. The dialog\nauto-dismisses after six seconds if the user walks away.",
      "tree": {
        "sha": "f03317790aeb98120af1a415333a782cc5bd56b9",
        "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/soapbox-pub/ditto/git/trees/f03317790aeb98120af1a415333a782cc5bd56b9"
      },
